 "brief_summary": "This study is being carried out to see if dapagliflozin as an addition to metformin is effective and safe in treating patients with type 2 diabetes when compared to glipizide (sulphonylurea) as an addition to metformin treatment.",
 "eligibility": {
  "criteria": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Type 2 Diabetes\n* Treated with oral anti-diabetic drug therapy therapy including Metformin for at least 8 weeks prior to enrolment\n* HbA1c \\>6.5% and \\</=10%\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Type 1 Diabetes\n* Insulin therapy within one year of enrolment\n* Renal (kidney) failure or dysfunction",
